  "POWER RESTORATION UPDATE\nAffected Areas: RF2 Lopue's San Sebastian, San Sebastian St. (from San Juan to Gatuslao St.), Araneta St. (Rodriguez Avenue – Gonzaga St.) Gaisano Grand Bacolod (old), part of Bacolod City Hall facing Araneta St. near Terry’s, Ballesteros St. NOHS, LCC HRM Sch.\nRestored at 6:16 AM\nOur dedicated team has successfully restored power to the affected areas.\nWe sincerely thank our valued consumers for your patience and continued support throughout the restoration process.\nIf you are still experiencing a power outage, kindly send us your account details and contact number so we can assist you as soon as possible.\nThank you for your patience and understanding.",
